# Normalize line endings on commit. Without this, files edited on Windows
# landed in the repo with CRLF (all 8 non-Korean docs/{lang}/ sets, plus
# package.json, .gitignore and the CI workflow) while the English docs and
# docs/ko/ stayed LF — noisy diffs and a needless barrier for contributors.
#
# After adding this file, run once:
#   git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must be LF regardless of platform — CRLF breaks the shebang.
*.sh text eol=lf
bootstrap.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
